### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Compare KV-cache occupancy, running requests and waiting requests. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Long contexts or high concurrency consuming the key/value cache.

### Fix
Adjust context and concurrency limits within the model budget; add capacity if demand requires it.

### Verify
KV-cache occupancy drops below the threshold and the request queue drains. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
